{
  "$comment": "Mentalaba AI — 100 Stress Test dataset v2. 12 blok, 100 test. Har bir test: conversation (ketma-ket user xabarlari), expected (kutilgan holat), must_not (bo'lmasligi kerak bo'lgan xatti-harakatlar). Har bir test 5 o'lchovda baholanadi: intent, entity/profile, memory, tool, response. Runner: backend/scripts/run-stress-tests.ts",
